# RoadMate Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
# .env is in .gitignore and will never be committed or uploaded to GitHub

# ==============================================================================
# ROUTING CONFIGURATION (OPTIONAL)
# ==============================================================================
# Free OpenRouteService API key (from https://openrouteservice.org/dev/#/signup)
# Optional: If not provided or left empty, RoadMate automatically uses free
# OpenStreetMap / OSRM routing with zero configuration!
OPENROUTESERVICE_API_KEY=""

# ==============================================================================
# DATABASE CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# RoadMate uses an embedded persistent SQLite database (node:sqlite) for journeys,
# stops, user preferences, orders, menus, and table reservations.
# NO external database or cloud database signup is required!
#
# (Optional) If you ever want to mirror data to an external Supabase instance in
# the future, you can provide these variables; otherwise leave them blank:
# SUPABASE_URL=""
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""
# SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=""

